@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Buscar eventos
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?city=Madrid&artist=ArtistName
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar sedes (venues)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/venues
Content-Type: application/json

### Búsqueda general
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/search
Content-Type: application/json

### Venue Plugin Manager: proveedores de integración registrados
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/venues
Content-Type: application/json

### Venue Plugin Manager: sincronizar mapa de asientos (adapter por defecto "generic")
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/venues/venue-1/seating-map
Content-Type: application/json

### Venue Plugin Manager: disponibilidad en tiempo real usando el adapter "legacy"
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/venues/venue-1/availability?provider=legacy
Content-Type: application/json

### Cancelar evento (publica el evento de dominio 'EventCancelled' vía RabbitMQ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/event-1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
